      "id": "J05",
      "lead": [
        {
          "text": "The x402 headers are PAYMENT-REQUIRED, which carries the challenge; PAYMENT-SIGNATURE carries the buyer payment proof; PAYMENT-RESPONSE carries settlement information.",
